[E0344] Error: a `dyn` type must be borrowed or owned
    ╭─[ err/673_a_dyn_neither_borrowed_nor_owned/main.wip:12:12 ]
    │
 12 │     shape: dyn Shape                        // in a field
    │            ────┬────
    │                ╰────── a value of unknown type has no size of its own
    │
    │ Help: borrow it
    │
    │ Note: a `dyn` value lives somewhere else, and is known by a pointer and a table of methods, so it exists only behind `&`, `&var` or `own`
